flowchart TD
 subgraph DEV[Development and human decisions - not runtime AI]
 AI["AI assists development / review / documentation only"] -. proposals .-> H["Human reviews units / physical time / binding / provenance / acceptance"]
 H -. versioned decisions .-> REG["Rule / implementation / test / approval registers"]
 end
 subgraph BUILD[Build time - repeat when definitions change]
 LM["LinkML + package metadata + explicit scientific policy"] --> B["build_dataset_metadata.R / build_parquet_contract.R<br/>check_approval.R / validate_release.R"]
 B --> PIN["Pinned JSON Schema / catalog / SQL / registry"]
 end
 REG -. reviewed policy .-> LM
 subgraph SCI[Unchanged Amadeus science]
 U["User variables / dates / sites / method / paths"] --> DL["amadeus::download_data"]
 DL --> PR["amadeus::process_covariates"]
 PR --> CA["amadeus::calculate_covariates<br/>ordinary results returned"]
 DL -. observe .-> REC["provenance_recorder.R<br/>actual calls / source identity / output context"]
 PR -. observe .-> REC
 CA -. observe .-> REC
 end
 subgraph BOUNDARY[After calculation - deterministic automatic checks]
 EX["export_gridmet.R<br/>verify actual request / result / recording consistency"] --> V["schema_export.R + storage_boundary.R<br/>JSON Schema / units / membership / dates / finite values / lineage"]
 V --> PQ["storage_boundary.R + parquet_experiment.R<br/>typed Parquet write and readback"]
 PQ --> DB["database.R + parquet_experiment.R<br/>load / SQL integrity / fidelity / reopen"]
 DB --> MF["storage_publish_manifest<br/>bind artifact bytes / release / instance / receipts"]
 MF --> WF["schema_export.R<br/>readonly files / completed workflow / final LATEST"]
 end
 CA --> EX
 REC --> EX
 PIN --> EX
 EX -. invalid .-> REJ["Reject acceptance or completion<br/>preserve diagnostics; no false publication"]
 V -. invalid .-> REJ
 PQ -. failed .-> REJ
 DB -. failed .-> REJ
 MF -. failed .-> REJ
 WF --> OPEN["database.R + storage_verify_publication<br/>verify completion / matching release / file identities at open"]
 OPEN --> Q["Read-only query of published DuckDB"]
 OPEN -. changed or incomplete .-> REJ
 CA -. separate qualification .-> QA["Direct source QA and independent replay"]
 Q -. receipts and outcomes .-> REG
 QA -. evidence .-> H
 GAP["11 pending gap actions<br/>policy / coverage / replay / trust / recovery / cost / scope"] -. closure evidence .-> H
